  npcName: Tony
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3de85220c25744058b13949a28eaddb7, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - The Name's Tony, it's a pleasure to meet ya.
  - I've heard some things about you...
  - ...mostly that you're a nuisance to the community and a sneaky thief, which is
    why I had my men hunt you down.
  - Let's cut to the cheese. I'm offering you $1M for the biggest job ever... to
    steal Chef Reggie's iconic secret cheese recipe.
  - Ever since he opened up, all of my customers have abandoned me! I asked one of
    my regulars why...
  - He said the cheese is so good that a guy proposed to his pasta last week!!!
  - 'So, are you up for the job? '
  - There's nothing crazy about this cheese recipe. Listen closely now...
  - "My intel says Reggie\u2019s restaurant is always empty after 9pm."
  - He stores the recipe in a big safe tucked away in the basement.
  - "You\u2019re going to need to find clues to figure out the password, but I have
    some starting points for you."
  - "Take a look at the file and when you\u2019re ready, I\u2019ll meet you outside! "
  - You have no idea. Listen closely now...
  - "My intel says Reggie\u2019s restaurant is always empty after 9pm."
  - He stores the recipe in a big safe tucked away in the basement.
  - "You\u2019re going to need to find clues to figure out the password, but I have
    some starting points for you."
  - "Take a look at the file and when you\u2019re ready, I\u2019ll meet you outside! "
  endDialogueLines: 0000000000000000000000010000000001
